<title>USA: Wireless Telecom gets $1.5 mln order.</title>
<headline>Wireless Telecom gets $1.5 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>PARAMUS, N.J. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wireless Telecom Group Inc said on Thursday it has received an initial order worth more than $1.5 million for satellite test systems to be used in the ICO Global Communications satellite network.</p>
<p>ICO is an international consortium of telecommunications service providers and network operators from 44 countries.</p>
<p>Wireless Telecom is a global provider of test equipment for the wireless telecommunications industry.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
